   191	The protected unit (BOOK_MAP §10 Tier A 5) reads "Deep layer. Sequence initiated" [a Compact date] "Unreadable. Not halted. Running. Correlated with classification event —". The source prints no value either ("She gave the date. It was a Compact date, a registry year and a day in it"). Sol's plan audit asked for an owner-supplied date. **Coordinator default:** the edition does as the source does — the sheet shows a date in the office's reckoning and the page never gives its figures, in Movement 2 or at the spring in Movement 3 (where Cael knows it for his Kindling day; no span of years is computed, #18). If the owner wants a printed registry date, it has to be minted and reconciled with #35/#42 (the series calendar), and ch12 and the spring scene re-touched.
