   357	**Seln.** Shadow; Bronze. One hound with a short knife; "It's clear because it's empty, not because it's safe". **He has read the original date in daylight, has told nobody, and has set the sheet before Cael without a word; he does not know for certain that it was read.** He has taught for the first time ("Draft nothing. Just look.", to Vastin). **He carries no box.** **The case is on him, shut; no ruling upon it.**
