   378	Movement 4 already carries day 281, six people/no mule, boxes on Brom/Lira/Cael, kit case on Vastin, the road posts, the inward reads, the station promise, and no new fragment (`packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:24,31–33,43–46`). Its author must additionally inherit the following surviving details:
