ft collar-bone and the ribs speaking; Karis, the left palm in linen ("Write. Don't lean."); Lira, the arm whole. **Load:** the mule has the three boxes, the flat, meal, Oryn's pannier and canvas; Vastin the tarred case (cord, mallet, stake thirty-two, never driven); Cael Hesk's book with the dividers shut in it (opened only ever by Karis). (10) **Seln's case is "shut"**, on his chest, contents unnamed, no count of years.
