+**PASS.** No unapproved proper name is minted. Proper names used in this movement—Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Vastin, Oryn, Teague, Cleon, Hesk, Pike, Ostrand, Ternhall, Denvash, Lowmarch, the Fallow, the Stair and the Span—are all already in the edition plan or closed text (`BOOK_MAP.md:480–484`; `chapter-54.md:3–361`; `chapter-60.md:3–277`). Pike, Hesk and Lowmarch are referenced but do not appear physically (`chapter-60.md:71,79,137–143`), consistent with `AUTHOR-REPORT.md:132`.
